  "source_text": "A gift for her mother was the explanation Amy Mihaljevic was given for an after-school meeting.\n\nAmy was ten. Before she disappeared on October 27, 1989, a caller had contacted her about celebrating her mother’s promotion. Bay Village Police say that contact happened weeks earlier.\n\nThe FBI says Amy walked from school to Bay Village Square in Ohio, where she was seen apparently waiting outside a business. Police describe witnesses seeing her speak with an unidentified man and walk through the parking lot with him.\n\nNo vehicle was seen, according to police. That sighting does not establish where Amy went next.\n",
